      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Regarding game wide notifications, they used to use an audio PA announcement in the Old Hub or another Official world on Sunday events when events used to be a thing.\n\nand yes some people dont want to read the update blogs, but they make a short a sweet announcement in the VRchat discord, make sure that your friends and other people that you meet that dont know about new big and small updates that they need to be in the VRChat discord to get regular updates about this information. https://discord.gg/vrchat",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
