      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5babfb12bf9da87d36048640|full_name}: That wont solve anything. They will see the update in discord, update the game but never read the patch notes. Even if they read the patch notes there is no guarantee they will understand the new feature. In most cases have to go from patch notes to a larger doc or blog page explaining how things work. Even after reading it they then ask us for help on what the new features mean.",
