      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We provide feedback on new features through the open beta. We mention simple things like not having the system enabled by default until the implementation is at least user friendly. Now they wonder why we get so angry. We are left to deal with all the support questions and explanations for these things due to horribly unfinished, unfriendly or complex implementations for game changing systems.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
