      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5babfb12bf9da87d36048640|full_name}: that's sort of the problem a lot of these people who don't learn about these things are in the vrchat Discord it's just simply that a lot of players aren't going to read the patch notes as a large majority of players don't really care about the stuff that's normally in patch notes. As most patch notes are just mentioning things such a small bug fixes. or changes to the SDK that are usually mostly just geared toward World creators. so in the rare instance where something significant is added like that there needs to have a notification somewhere like in game that will actually grab the average players attention so that people are more inclined to pay attention to it and significantly lessen panic and confusion",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
